{
    "title": "School Break: Obby Escape",
    "description": "Welcome to School Break: Obby School, where danger and adventure collide! \ud83c\udfeb\ud83d\udca5 Can you outsmart the evil Mr. Fat and make a daring prison escape from the haunted block school? This fast-paced runner game combines thrilling action with tricky obby maps full of obstacles that will push your skills to the limit. \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nEscape the Block School: Navigate through creepy, abandoned hallways filled with deadly traps. Beware of Mr. Fat, the evil teacher on your trail! \ud83c\udfeb\ud83d\ude08\r\nExciting Prison Escape Challenge: Can you survive the school obby and make your way out? Each map brings new surprises and escalating danger! \ud83d\udeaa\ud83c\udf92\r\nObby Maps and Challenges: Jump, slide, and dodge your way through a variety of obby maps packed with difficult obstacles. Each level is a new adventure! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83c\udf00\r\nJoystick Controls: Use the joystick to steer your character through the block school, make precision jumps, and dodge deadly traps! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\r\nThrilling Gameplay: Intense runner action and heart-pounding moments filled with mystery and suspense! \u26a1\u2753\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\nUse the joystick to move through the eerie halls of the block school. \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\r\nJump over obstacles, dodge traps, and uncover hidden escape routes. \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc6\r\nBe fast, because Mr. Fat is always chasing you\u2014don\u2019t let him catch you! \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc40\r\nWhy Play:\r\nObby Escape: This game\u2019s mix of action and puzzle-solving makes every run exciting! \ud83d\udd25\r\nChallenging Obstacles: Only the fastest and smartest can escape the school. Are you up for the challenge? \ud83e\udd14\ud83d\uded1\r\nMysterious School: Discover the dark secrets of the block school as you fight to survive! \ud83c\udfeb\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\r\nCompete and Escape: Test your skills and compete with friends to see who can escape the fastest! \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udfc5\r\nDon\u2019t miss out! Download School Break: Obby School now and experience the thrill of escaping from Mr. Fat! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8",
